model g13_depth_from
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.2 (issue #29), G13: L §2.3 LOAD-DEPTH counts the from term a point is inside, one level, as an if counts. Inside the parentheses of q's from term the depth is 7 brackets + the from term + its own bracket = 9, past the limit of 8, so the load is refused. Its twin g13/depth_from_ok has 6 brackets (depth 8) and answers. tally 2.1.1 counted no from term (depth 8 here) and answered 5.00 PLN."

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input d0: date

input d1: date

place acc: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

ask q: (((((((bal(acc, d1) from (d0))))))))

version facts
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  d0 = 2026-01-01
  d1 = 2026-02-01
  opening[acc] = 5.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
